\\"}]}\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"The existing dedicated `UnsafeAccessTest` already exercises the exact public path: constructing `MpscLinkedQueue` initializes both linked-queue node-reference classes and `LinkedQueueNode`, while offer/peek/poll validate the queue remains functional. This reaches `producerNode`, `consumerNode`, and `next` through `UnsafeAccess.fieldOffset` without direct reflection. I’m checking the final scoped diff and repository state; no metadata files will be edited.\", \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_08e95c7547e49c22016a80b10994e887d0bbed0df40f9c9dd4\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"}\"}, {\"type\": \"toolCall\", \"id\": \"call_duTcF3n8hi1zVHZYyimSH3aV|fc_08e95c7547e49c22016a80b10c5c6487d0ab8e4fef29eb821d\", \"name\": \"bash\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"git diff HEAD^ --check -- tests/src/org.jctools/jctools-core/4.0.3 && git diff --stat HEAD^ -- tests/src/org.jctools/jctools-core/4.0.3 && git status --short -- tests/src/org.jctools/jctools-core/4.0.3\", \"timeout\": 10}}, {\"type\": \"toolCall\", \"id\": \"call_Jphz2ZfHPcPCANQGSSiVPfR9|fc_08e95c7547e49c22016a80b10c5c7c87d0a5ca287a7bd92253\", \"name\": \"bash\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"nl -ba tests/src/org.jctools/jctools-core/4.0.3/src/test/java/org_jctools/jctools_core/UnsafeAccessTest.java | head -80\", \"timeout\": 10}}], \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\", \"provider\": \"openai-codex\", \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\", \"usage\": {\"input\": 4771, \"output\": 1072, \"cacheRead\": 42496, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"reasoning\": 810, \"totalTokens\": 48339, \"cost\": {\"input\": 0, \"output\": 0, \"cacheRead\": 0, \"cacheWrite\": 0, \"total\": 0}}, \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\", \"timestamp\": 1786818802996, \"responseId\": \"resp_08e95c7547e49c22016a80b0f3398087d0b0bf198ec1addc27\", \"rawStopReason\": \"completed\"}, \"toolResults\": [{\"role\": \"toolResult\", \"toolCallId\": \"call_duTcF3n8hi1zVHZYyimSH3aV|fc_08e95c7547e49c22016a80b10c5c6487d0ab8e4fef29e